{
  "id": "universal-slide-off",
  "name": "Slide off",
  "part": "tech",
  "characters": "all",
  "goal": "Slide off a platform during landing lag",
  "why": "Landing lag stops {char} from acting but not from sliding. A slide that carries {char} off a platform ends the landing lag at once, so {char} is in the air and can act while an opponent expects {char} to be stuck on the platform.",
  "tutorial": {
    "camera": {
      "follow": "player",
      "distance": 120,
      "height": 10
    },
    "what": "A slide off is a landing that slides {char} over the edge of a platform before the landing lag ends. The rest of the landing lag is gone.",
    "expect": "Each jump is judged when the landing lag ends or is cut short: whether {char} landed with an air dodge, stopped at the edge, or slid off, and after how many frames on the platform.",
    "example": [
      {
        "press": "jump",
        "frame": 1,
        "hold": 1
      },
      {
        "press": "R",
        "frame": "J+1"
      },
      {
        "stick": [
          0.8,
          -0.6
        ],
        "frame": "J+1",
        "hold": 1
      },
      {
        "stick": [
          1,
          0
        ],
        "frame": "J+2",
        "hold": 15
      }
    ],
    "marks": {
      "1": "Frame 1: jump pressed and released",
      "J+1": "Frame {J+1}: R and the stick down and toward the edge: air dodge into the platform",
      "J+2": "Frame {J+2}: landing lag. Stick held toward the edge",
      "J+5": "Frame {J+5}: off the edge: the landing lag is over"
    },
    "lessons": [
      {
        "title": "Landing lag slides",
        "text": [
          "An air dodge into the ground lands {char} in 10 frames of landing lag, the same for every character. The air dodge's speed carries into the landing, so {char} slides along the ground during them.",
          "Landing lag stops {char} from acting, not from moving. Air dodge on the first frame in the air, down and toward the edge, and {char} lands at once and slides toward it."
        ],
        "show": {
          "example": {
            "inputs": [
              {
                "press": "jump",
                "frame": 1,
                "hold": 1
              },
              {
                "press": "R",
                "frame": "J+1"
              },
              {
                "stick": [
                  0.8,
                  -0.6
                ],
                "frame": "J+1",
                "hold": 1
              }
            ],
            "marks": {
              "1": "Frame 1: jump pressed and released",
              "J+1": "Frame {J+1}: R and the stick down and toward the edge: air dodge into the platform",
              "J+2": "Frame {J+2}: landing lag, sliding"
            },
            "cues": [
              {
                "frames": [
                  1,
                  "J"
                ],
                "words": "Jump squat",
                "kind": "info"
              },
              {
                "frames": [
                  "J+1",
                  "J+1"
                ],
                "words": "Air dodge down and forward",
                "kind": "go"
              },
              {
                "frames": [
                  "J+2",
                  "J+3"
                ],
                "words": "Landing lag: sliding",
                "kind": "info"
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "title": "At the edge",
        "text": [
          "When the slide reaches the edge, the game reads which way {char} faces and the control stick. Facing the edge, with the stick short of 0.75 toward it, {char} stops at the edge and teeters. Facing away from the edge, or with the stick past 0.75 toward it, {char} slides off and falls.",
          "Either way the landing lag ends there. Sliding off puts {char} in the air below the platform; teetering keeps {char} on it."
        ],
        "show": {
          "example": {
            "inputs": [
              {
                "press": "jump",
                "frame": 1,
                "hold": 1
              },
              {
                "press": "R",
                "frame": "J+1"
              },
              {
                "stick": [
                  0.8,
                  -0.6
                ],
                "frame": "J+1",
                "hold": 1
              },
              {
                "stick": [
                  1,
                  0
                ],
                "frame": "J+2",
                "hold": 15
              }
            ],
            "marks": {
              "J+1": "Frame {J+1}: air dodge into the platform",
              "J+2": "Frame {J+2}: stick held toward the edge",
              "J+5": "Frame {J+5}: off the edge: the landing lag is over"
            },
            "cues": [
              {
                "frames": [
                  "J+2",
                  "J+4"
                ],
                "words": "Hold toward the edge",
                "kind": "go"
              },
              {
                "frames": [
                  "J+5",
                  "J+12"
                ],
                "words": "Off the edge: in the air",
                "kind": "info"
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      }
    ]
  },
  "scenarios": [
    {
      "name": "On a platform, facing its edge",
      "stage": "battlefield",
